config TRACKBALL_BOOT_BUTTON
    bool "Enter the bootloader when the left button is held at power up"
    default y if SHIELD_TRACKBALL_WIRELESS || SHIELD_TRACKBALL_WIRELESS_LEFT
    help
      Reads the first button of the trackball_buttons kscan right after boot. If it
      is held, the board reboots into the UF2 bootloader. Needs the nRF52 UF2
      bootloader of the nice!nano, and does nothing if the firmware cannot start.
